feat(simscape): promote gs3dx variants with reproducible r2025b evidence (#11087)

Closes #11087.

- Promoted GS3DX Variants & Evidence Contracts (`src/shared/python/motion_matching/gs3dx_variants.py`):
  - Canonical inventory and per-variant machine-readable receipts across all 10 lineage stages: Baseline, Slim, Quat, FullBody, Contact, Golfer, Fit, Shape, Neck, and Human.
  - Fail-closed clean-host build, save, and reopen verification under MATLAB R2025b; rejects non-R2025b releases (no R2026a substitution), dirty saves, and unrecorded hosts.
  - Protection contract for hand-built originals (`GolfSwing3D_Kinetic.slx`, `Kinetically_Driven_Gimbal_Joint.slx`, `Kinetically_Driven_Revolute_Joint.slx`, `Kinetically_Driven_Universal_Joint.slx`) verifying byte-identical integrity via SHA-256 digests.
  - Strict separation of stable-drive equivalence (impact torque drive reproduction on Baseline/Slim/Quat) from C3D motion capture marker fitting (Fit/Shape/Neck/Human); rejects conflation or false physical acceptance claims.
  - Explicit disclosure of motion-prescribed neck actuation (`NeckReference`, 2-axis Universal Joint with 5 ms filter) and damped inverse-Jacobian leg servo tracking; rejects claims of autonomous balance or neuromuscular control.
  - Cold-replay commands, provider/model/capture provenance, and cryptographic candidate/image/metric hash integrity verification (`validate_candidate_package_integrity`).
  - Main ledger consumption gate (`filter_promotable_ledger_variants`) allowing only reviewed promoted variants (`GS3DX_Human`) to enter the primary motion matching ledger while rejecting intermediate variants.
  - Reported MATLAB test suite rerun validator (`validate_matlab_suite_run`) requiring exact promoted SHA verification and explicit disclosure of all skipped tests with reasons.

- Reference Models, Tools, Tests & Receipts (`src/engines/Simscape_Multibody_Models/3D_Golf_Model/matlab/exploratory_gs3dx/`):
  - Added model definitions and reference builders, tools, and test suites.
  - Committed 10 machine-readable variant receipts in `receipts/` (`Baseline_receipt.json` .. `Human_receipt.json`).

- Documentation & Specification:
  - Updated `SPEC.md` top section with MMR-03 promotion and evidence contracts.
  - Updated `SPEC.md` Change Log table with entry for #11087.

- Verification:
  - Unit test suite: `tests/unit/motion_matching/test_gs3dx_variants_promotion.py` covering all 10 variants and contract criteria under strict TDD.
